        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Ives FB457, Manual Flush Bolt For Metal Door</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe UL Listed Flush Bolt for Metal Doors is used to secure the inactive door on a set of double doors no matter if the active door is open or closed. When the inactive door is closed, moving the lock lever up locks it and moving the lever down unlocks it. This flush bolt has a 12 inch extension.The Manual Flush Bolt For Metal Door is for for use on metal fire doors up to 8 feet x 10 feet for up to 3 hours. It comes packaged with installation hardware, guide plate, and strike.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Ives FB457 Hollow Metal Door Flush Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI 156.16. UL Listed for use on metal fire doors up to 8'0\" x 10'0\" for up to 3 hours (requires top and bottom bolt).</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with strike and guide plates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ives FB457 Manual Flush Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Body Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Body Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Body Depth: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Guide Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Guide Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Guide Thickness: 5/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Thickness: 5/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Rod Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Backset: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt throw: 3/4\" with a 7/8\" vertical adjustment</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Tip Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting: 8-32 X 1\" FPHMS</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
